Use io and string.

Let value be 1994.
Let answer be create an empty text.

Repeat while value is at least 1000:
    Append to address of answer text "M" of length 1.
    Subtract 1000 from value.
If value is at least 900:
    Append to address of answer text "CM" of length 2.
    Subtract 900 from value.
If value is at least 500:
    Append to address of answer text "D" of length 1.
    Subtract 500 from value.
If value is at least 400:
    Append to address of answer text "CD" of length 2.
    Subtract 400 from value.
Repeat while value is at least 100:
    Append to address of answer text "C" of length 1.
    Subtract 100 from value.
If value is at least 90:
    Append to address of answer text "XC" of length 2.
    Subtract 90 from value.
If value is at least 50:
    Append to address of answer text "L" of length 1.
    Subtract 50 from value.
If value is at least 40:
    Append to address of answer text "XL" of length 2.
    Subtract 40 from value.
Repeat while value is at least 10:
    Append to address of answer text "X" of length 1.
    Subtract 10 from value.
If value is at least 9:
    Append to address of answer text "IX" of length 2.
    Subtract 9 from value.
If value is at least 5:
    Append to address of answer text "V" of length 1.
    Subtract 5 from value.
If value is at least 4:
    Append to address of answer text "IV" of length 2.
    Subtract 4 from value.
Repeat while value is at least 1:
    Append to address of answer text "I" of length 1.
    Subtract 1 from value.

Say answer.
str_free(address of answer).
Return 0.
